Zlib: gzip and deflate files and output compression, with the zlib of
the base system.

The module zlib of PHP 8.1 for php81 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20210902/zlib.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php81/conf.d, its headers in
include/php81/php/ext/zlib.
